{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16207070","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16207070","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1620707001:1":{"text":"莱纳斯……莱纳斯……","source_cn":"莱纳斯……莱纳斯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x835E35B21C14286D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1620707002:1":{"text":"嘿！皮帕，你是在找我吗？我就在你旁边！","source_cn":"嘿！皮帕，你是在找我吗？我就在你旁边！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65DF9A80E3FE0AAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1620707003:1":{"text":"对对对对不起！我刚才没有看到你！","source_cn":"对对对对不起！我刚才没有看到你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE258A3E04F9AFB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1620707004:1":{"text":"梅林大人也在呢！<male>他</male><female>她</female>刚刚还体验了你发明的混沌魔法！","source_cn":"梅林大人也在呢！<male>他</male><fema...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x11A41F7C95FA372E","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"梅林大人也在呢！<male>他</male><female>她</female>刚刚还体验了你发明的混沌魔法！","female":"梅林大人也在呢！<male>他</male><female>她</female>刚刚还体验了你发明的混沌魔法！","variant_male_record_index":"203838","variant_female_record_index":"203839","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1620707005:1":{"text":"说起来还要感谢你教会了我用它，太了不起了！我已经迫不及待让更多人体验到它的乐趣了！","source_cn":"说起来还要感谢你教会了我用它，太了不起了！我已经迫不及...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD25C2C91C1575C66","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1620707006:1":{"text":"欸……啊啊啊等等！我想找你说的就是这个！","source_cn":"欸……啊啊啊等等！我想找你说的就是这个！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6DA4E24F0441FC28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1620707007:1":{"text":"我记得我昨天只教了你使用混沌魔法的方法，为什么今天学校里这么多人都在用……","source_cn":"我记得我昨天只教了你使用混沌魔法的方法，为什么今天学校...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x757F21D9CD70715B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1620707008:1":{"text":"这个……一传十十传百嘛，好玩的事情大家都想尝试！","source_cn":"这个……一传十十传百嘛，好玩的事情大家都想尝试！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8B5A2A31053D43CD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1620707009:1":{"text":"可是，没办法控制魔法的结果，就有可能发生危险的事……","source_cn":"可是，没办法控制魔法的结果，就有可能发生危险的事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1667625042A9210D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1620707010:1":{"text":"如果混沌魔法引发了危险的事，再被学校发现发明这种危险魔法的人是我，我一定会被退学吧！一定会的！","source_cn":"如果混沌魔法引发了危险的事，再被学校发现发明这种危险魔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6E50BB69D340258","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1620707011:1":{"text":"危险？我看不出混沌魔法会有什么危险啊。","source_cn":"危险？我看不出混沌魔法会有什么危险啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB5980BF74A69D070","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1620707012:1":{"text":"放心吧，我从昨天到今天已经用了很多次了，不会有什么危险的！你看，我再试一次——","source_cn":"放心吧，我从昨天到今天已经用了很多次了，不会有什么危险...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4DE793D7AC687A92","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"皮帕","source":"皮帕","status":"source"},"speaker:莱纳斯":{"text":"莱纳斯","source":"莱纳斯","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":13,"localized_text_count":12,"speaker_count":2}}